    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How to say a date",
     "texto": [
      "The usual order is **tanggal + number + month + year**: «tanggal lima belas Oktober dua ribu dua puluh enam». **Tanggal** is the date or day of the month; **hari** is the day of the week."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Names of months",
     "texto": [
      "Month names are written with a capital letter. **Bulan** means \"month\" and also \"moon\"; context makes the meaning clear."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
